// Pending increase-edit cluster — null when no edit is in flight.
// pendingEditCheckoutSession is @unique: one Stripe session per order at a time.
pendingEditTotalCents       Int?
pendingEditCheckoutSession  String?   @unique
pendingEditCreatedAt        DateTime?

// Supplemental charge from a finalized increase-edit.
// Payment.providerPaymentIntent is NEVER overwritten — it stays as the
// original charge. This pair tracks the one allowed delta charge per order.
// If multi-edit is ever needed, replace with an OrderPaymentCharge join table.
deltaPaymentIntentId        String?
deltaAmountCents            Int?

